#: ../../src/errors.rst:351
msgid ""
"Macro that expands to a series of invocations of `iter_macro` for each of"
" the error constants above. `iter_macro` is invoked with two arguments: "
"the name of the error constant without the `UV_` prefix, and the error "
"message string literal."
msgstr "该宏会针对上述每一个错误码常量展开为一系列对 `iter_macro` 的调用。`iter_macro` 调用时传入两个参数：不带 `UV_` 前缀的错误码常量名，以及错误信息字符串字面量。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:358
msgid ""
"Returns the error message for the given error code.  Leaks a few bytes of"
" memory when you call it with an unknown error code."
msgstr "返回给定错误码对应的错误信息。以未知的错误码调用该函数时，会泄漏几个字节的内存。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:363
msgid ""
"Returns the error message for the given error code. The zero-terminated "
"message is stored in the user-supplied buffer `buf` of at most `buflen` "
"bytes."
msgstr "返回给定错误码对应的错误信息。以空字符结尾的错误信息存储在用户提供的缓冲区 `buf` 中，该缓冲区最多为 `buflen` 字节。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:370
msgid ""
"Returns the error name for the given error code.  Leaks a few bytes of "
"memory when you call it with an unknown error code."
msgstr "返回给定错误码对应的错误名称。以未知的错误码调用该函数时，会泄漏几个字节的内存。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:375
msgid ""
"Returns the error name for the given error code. The zero-terminated name"
" is stored in the user-supplied buffer `buf` of at most `buflen` bytes."
msgstr "返回给定错误码对应的错误名称。以空字符结尾的名称存储在用户提供的缓冲区 `buf` 中，该缓冲区最多为 `buflen` 字节。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:382
msgid ""
"Returns the libuv error code equivalent to the given platform dependent "
"error code: POSIX error codes on Unix (the ones stored in `errno`), and "
"Win32 error codes on Windows (those returned by `GetLastError()` or "
"`WSAGetLastError()`)."
msgstr "返回与给定平台相关错误码等价的 libuv 错误码：在 Unix 上为 POSIX 错误码（即存储在 `errno` 中的那些），在 Windows 上为 Win32 错误码（即 `GetLastError()` 或 `WSAGetLastError()` 返回的那些）。"

#: ../../src/errors.rst:386
msgid "If `sys_errno` is already a libuv error, it is simply returned."
msgstr "如果 `sys_errno` 已经是 libuv 错误码，则直接返回该值。"

